program	errors/capture_borrow_escaping.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	borrow capture `&var sum` is legal only in a closure passed directly to a non-escaping parameter
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: borrow capture `&var sum` is legal only in a closure passed directly to a non-escaping parameter"
log	"  --> examples/errors/capture_borrow_escaping.saw:11:32"
log	"     |"
log	" 11 |     let task = Thread.spawn { [&var sum] in"
log	"     |                                ^"
log	"   hint: an escaping closure outlives the frame, so it cannot borrow it — capture by value (`move`/`copy`) instead"
log	""
log	"error: cannot call `&var self` method `join` on immutable variable `task`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/capture_borrow_escaping.saw:15:9"
log	"     |"
log	" 15 |     task.join()"
log	"     |         ^"
log	"   hint: consider using `var` instead of `let` to make it mutable"
log	""
